# Gate step 1260-2qgi — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# A status carried by a channel is PRESERVED or DECLARED ABSENT, never a
# substituted integer (methodology/convergence.yaml -> status_channel_policy).
# The channel is the agent door, `tillandsias-plan run --json` (1443-8pur):
# a killed child reads absent, a failed producer piped to tee reads red, and
# exit 0 still reads green.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
